table FactTargetRate
	lineageTag: 5402683d-1541-4225-9460-15d21dda56dc

	measure 'Frequency Rate - Amber Target' = ```
			
			/* DOCUMENTATION *
			Get a target for the context month.
			It assumes the target data has been validated and does not contain any mid month changes or ovelapping rates.
			In the unlikely event there are overlaps the max value will be returned.
			This measure should only be used to compare monthly actuals vs target and not weekly, quarterely or yearly.
			*/
			
			VAR TargetRecord =
			 FILTER('FactTargetRate',
			       [Matching Targets Frequency Rate] <> BLANK()
			 )
			
			VAR target =  
			CALCULATE(
			    MAX('FactTargetRate'[Amber max]),
			    TargetRecord 
			   )
			
			RETURN
			target
			```
		formatString: 0
		displayFolder: 1. Measures
		lineageTag: 4ea78509-4cbb-43b9-80db-c43c5f14cebb

